WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.090
Selenium.

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:12.160
So selenium is an element that’s quite like
sulphur. But, sulphur has its

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.300
common form in S8 rings whereas selenium exists
in its more common

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:22.480
form as long chains of selenium atoms and
if you shine light on these

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:28.420
chains they start conducting electricity.
So selenium was the material

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:33.220
that was used in the early photo cells for
things like burglar alarms and

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.160
doors that open themselves and so on.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.210
So here is a sample of selenium and we’re
going to unpack it from the

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.969
box here. And it’s in the form of a shot.

00:00:42.969 --> 00:00:47.510
Selenium has a number of other applications
and perhaps the one that

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:53.250
amuses me most is that it’s used in shampoos.
Some people, as you

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:59.770
know, get dandruff which is caused by bacteria
on their scalp and if you

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:05.519
use a compound which is a ring, which is a
mixture of sulphur and

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:12.520
selenium, this can be added to shampoo and
will act as a bactericide and

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.359
will kill bacteria that cause dandruff.

00:01:16.359 --> 00:01:22.549
So let’s see what comes out. I can hear
it and here you can see the

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:30.279
selenium, wonderful black compound. Beautiful
element, again this is a

00:01:30.279 --> 00:01:33.859
mineral which is useful for us and in fact
many people often take

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:37.509
selenium as an additive to their diet.

00:01:37.509 --> 00:01:42.189
However you have to be careful because the
compounds that make our

00:01:42.189 --> 00:01:49.469
sweat smell are sulphur compounds, so if you
get selenium into the body

00:01:49.469 --> 00:01:53.869
then you make similar compounds of selenium
but which smell much

00:01:53.869 --> 00:02:00.320
worse. And so it is said that people get off
the bus when selenium

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.329
chemists get on. And tellurium is even worse
still.

